    "name": "sentry-debug-issue",
    "title": {
      "zh-CN": "sentry-debug-issue（Sentry）",
      "zh-TW": "sentry-debug-issue（Sentry）",
      "en": "sentry-debug-issue (Sentry)"
    },
    "summary": {
      "zh-CN": "调试并修复一个 Sentry Issue：按链接、ID 或搜索找到它，拉取完整上下文（堆栈、面包屑、trace、日志），可选运行 Seer 根因分析/自动修复，应用代码修复，并通过带 Fixes PROJECT-NAME-12A 的提交/PR 解决。",
      "zh-TW": "除錯並修復一個 Sentry Issue：按連結、ID 或搜尋找到它，拉取完整上下文（堆疊、麵包屑、trace、日誌），可選執行 Seer 根因分析/自動修復，套用程式碼修復，並透過帶 Fixes PROJECT-NAME-12A 的提交/PR 解決。",
      "en": "Debug and fix a Sentry issue — find it (by link, ID, or search), pull full context (stack trace, breadcrumbs, trace, logs), optionally run Seer root-cause / autofix, apply the code fix, and resolve it via a `Fixes PROJECT-NAME-12A` commit/PR. Use when working a known error or hunting one down to fix."
    }
  },
